# shop-ui

Headless fashion storefront for **Sable Muse** (`sablemuse.shop`). Customer-facing copy is Sable Muse, United States shipping, and US dollars. Do not reintroduce Modimal or ModiWeek. Internal cart and customer cookies still use the older `modimal_` names.

Stack: Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind v4, shadcn style `base-nova` on **Base UI** (`@base-ui/react`), not Radix. Alias `@/*` → `src/*`.

Before changing Next.js APIs, read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`. Before non-trivial work, read `docs/agent-guide.md`.

## Where code lives

- `src/app` — routes. Pages are Server Components. No `middleware.ts`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, or `not-found.tsx`.
- `src/lib/shopify` — Storefront GraphQL, mappers, cart server actions.
- `src/lib/customer` + `src/app/api/auth` — Customer Account OAuth. Login and register both hit `/api/auth/login`.
- `src/data` — nav, FAQ, sustainability story, filter chrome. Not the product catalog. `/modiweek` and `/plus-size` redirect to `/collection/new-arrivals`.
- `src/types/commerce.ts` — `Product`, `ProductDetail`, `CartSummary`.
- `src/components/ui` — primitives. App UI is the other folders under `src/components`.

Root layout awaits `fetchCart()`, then `WishlistProvider` → `CartProvider` → `SiteHeader`, `main`, `SiteFooter`.

## Invariants

- `Product.id` is the Shopify **handle**. The GID is `ProductDetail.gid`. `/product/[id]` passes `id` to `getProduct`, which queries `product(handle:)`.
- Catalog reads fail soft (`[]` or `null`). There is no mock catalog. `SHOPIFY_USE_MOCK_FALLBACK` is unused.
- This app never collects cards. Payment is a redirect to `cart.checkoutUrl`.
- Storefront and customer tokens stay server-only. Do not add `NEXT_PUBLIC_` copies.
- Storefront API and Customer Account API only. Do not add Admin API calls.
- Search and collection filter sidebars do not change the Shopify query. Do not “finish” that unless asked.
- No semicolons. Double quotes, `const` arrows, `handle*` event names, Tailwind on elements, kebab-case files. Base UI links use `render={<Link href="..." />}` and `nativeButton={false}`, not Radix `asChild`.

## Commands

`npm run dev` (port 3000), `npm run lint`, `npm run test:e2e` (Playwright on `127.0.0.1:4173`). E2E still expects some Modimal copy and `localStorage` keys the app no longer uses.
